  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-release · JOJO&Adam",
      "text": "把自己的 DSH 插件从「改完代码」送到「用户能装」，一条命令跑完：\n\n```\ncheck → 升版本 → 测试 → commit → SSH push → npm publish → 等 registry 生效 →（可选）装桌面版\n```\n\n凭据只从 macOS 钥匙串读，不落盘、不打印。默认只读，写操作必须 `--yes`。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add @jojonadam/dsh-release\ndsh plugin --profile desktop add @jojonadam/dsh-release\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "用法",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "环境体检（token / SSH / dsh CLI）",
      "text": "node skills/dsh-release/scripts/release.mjs doctor"
    },
    {
      "section": "预检（只读）",
      "text": "node skills/dsh-release/scripts/release.mjs check --dir /path/to/dsh-xxx"
    },
    {
      "section": "预检 + 脱敏扫描（包内文件 + ~/.dsh/memory）",
      "text": "node skills/dsh-release/scripts/release.mjs check --dir /path/to/dsh-xxx --scan"
    },
    {
      "section": "预览发布计划",
      "text": "node skills/dsh-release/scripts/release.mjs release --dir /path/to/dsh-xxx --bump patch --dry-run"
    },
    {
      "section": "只安装已发布版本",
      "text": "node skills/dsh-release/scripts/release.mjs install --dir /path/to/dsh-xxx"
    },
    {
      "section": "真发布",
      "text": "node skills/dsh-release/scripts/release.mjs release --dir /path/to/dsh-xxx --bump patch --yes"
    },
    {
      "section": "发完装进桌面版",
      "text": "node skills/dsh-release/scripts/release.mjs release --dir /path/to/dsh-xxx --bump patch --yes --install"
    },
    {
      "section": "提交到 dsh-plugin-hub",
      "text": "node skills/dsh-release/scripts/release.mjs hub-issue --dir /path/to/dsh-xxx \\\n  --category \"Tools & Capabilities\" --value \"一句话价值\"\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "凭据",
      "text": "| 凭据 | 位置 |\n|---|---|\n| npm token | 钥匙串 generic `dsh-npm-token` |\n| GitHub token | 钥匙串 internet password `github.com` |\n| SSH key | `~/.ssh/id_ed25519_dsh` |\n\n换账号或改 scope 时，改脚本顶部常量即可。"
    },
    {
      "section": "它替你记住的坑",
      "text": "- `cordis.patch.yml` 的 name 必须等于 package.json 的 name，否则装不上；\n- scoped 包必须 `publishConfig.access=public`；\n- `npm pack` 不能带 `test/`；\n- 发布前扫明文密钥与本机路径，high 级命中直接阻断（`--no-scan` 可跳过）；\n- 首次发布 registry 有几分钟 202 延迟，必须轮询而不是重发；\n- npmmirror 对新包不同步，发布/安装都显式走 npmjs；\n- pnpm 的 `minimumReleaseAge` 会挡新版本，安装前要写豁免；\n- `github.com` HTTPS 不通时改用 SSH，key 与 known_hosts 都显式指定。"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT · JOJO & Adam · <https://jojo-adam.com>"
    }
